      <reaction compartment="compartment_5460" fast="false" id="reaction_109339" metaid="metaid_107" name="Linoleoyl-CoA is converted to cis,cis-3,6- dodecadienoyl-CoA by three cycles of beta-oxidation" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <html:p>Three cycles of beta oxidation, each mediated by the activities of trifunctional protein and ACADL tetramer, convert linoleoyl-CoA to cis,cis-3,6-dodecadienoyl-CoA plus three molecules each of CoA-SH, FADH2, and NADH + H+.</html:p>
        </notes>
        <annotation>
