      <reaction compartment="compartment_5460" fast="false" id="reaction_77256" metaid="metaid_109" name="2-trans-Dodecenoyl-CoA+H2O =&gt;( S)-3-Hydroxydodecanoyl-CoA" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <html:p>ECHS1 in the mitochondrial matrix hydrates trans-dodec-2-enoyl-CoA to form (S)-3-hydroxylauroyl-CoA (Stern and Del Campillo 1956).</html:p>
        </notes>
