      <reaction compartment="compartment_5460" fast="false" id="reaction_109338" metaid="metaid_111" name="Isomerization of cis,cis-3,6-Dodecadienoyl-CoA to form trans,cis-Lauro-2,6-dienoyl-CoA" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <html:p>At the beginning of this reaction, 1 molecule of 'cis,cis-3,6-Dodecadienoyl-CoA' is present. At the end of this reaction, 1 molecule of 'trans,cis-Lauro-2,6-dienoyl-CoA ' is present. This reaction takes place in the 'mitochondrial matrix' and is mediated by the 'dodecenoyl-CoA delta-isomerase activity' of '3,2-trans-enoyl-CoA isomerase Homodimer'.</html:p>
        </notes>
