      <reaction compartment="compartment_5460" fast="false" id="reaction_77321" metaid="metaid_112" name="3-Oxohexanoyl-CoA+CoA-SH =&gt; Butanoyl-CoA + acetyl-CoA" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <html:p>Trifunctional protein in the mitochondrial matrix converts 3-oxohexanoyl-CoA to butanoyl-CoA plus acetyl-CoA (Carpenter et al. 1992).</html:p>
        </notes>
