      <reaction compartment="compartment_5460" fast="false" id="reaction_109341" metaid="metaid_134" name="dehydrogenation of 4-cis-decenoyl-CoA to form 2-trans-4-cis-decadienoyl-CoA" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <html:p>4-cis-decenoyl-CoA transits through the first step of the saturated beta-oxidation spiral to yield 2-trans-4-cis-decadienoyl-CoA.</html:p>
        </notes>
