      <reaction compartment="compartment_5460" fast="false" id="reaction_77263" metaid="metaid_138" name="lauroyl-CoA+FAD =&gt; 2-trans-Dodecenoyl-CoA+FADH2" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <html:p>ACADL in the mitochondrial matrix dehydrogenates lauroyl-CoA to form trans-dodec-2-enoyl-CoA. (Krane and Beinert 1956; Kelley 1992).</html:p>
        </notes>
