      <reaction compartment="compartment_5460" fast="false" id="reaction_109342" metaid="metaid_149" name="Trans,cis-lauro-2,6-dienoyl-CoA is converted to cis,cis-3,6- 4-cis-decenoyl-CoA by one cycle of beta-oxidation" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <html:p>One cycle of beta oxidation, each mediated by the activities of trifunctional protein and ACADL tetramer, converts trans,cis-lauro-2,6-dienoyl-CoA to 4-cis-decenoyl-CoA plus molecules of CoA-SH, FADH2, and NADH + H+.</html:p>
        </notes>
